{"version":1,"content":"<p>三星電子正在探索新一代流動裝置形態。根據最新曝光的信息，該公司正在研發一款配備可擴展顯示屏的智能手機，試圖在傳統直板手機與摺疊屏設備之外開闢新的產品路線。若項目最終實現量產，用户將能夠根據需要動態改變屏幕尺寸，在便攜性與大屏體驗之間取得平衡。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585890.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:54:09.549041+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:31:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:19.460180+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:19.460180+00:00","content_hash":"51b7ce7db99e7c663603be83d7c8a56f9806127116a491c1d4f74746ef3142ad","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}